# Brewfile — replaces modules/darwin/homebrew.nix + casks.nix and the
# environment.systemPackages from shared/default.nix.
#
# Managed by `make update` (brew bundle dump). Hand-edit to remove/change;
# `brew bundle --global --force` in run_onchange_brewfile.sh then prunes
# anything you drop (the `cleanup = uninstall` behaviour).

# Third-party tap (Homebrew 6+: run_onchange_brewfile.sh runs `brew trust`
